Subject: build,v8: mobile host/target settings in v8 gypfiles — ported to v26.10.0

Derived from gmaclennan/nodejs-mobile recipe (Node 24.18.0). Changes vs the
reference patch for the v26 port:
 - upstream now ships an is_android block and an arm64 push_registers entry,
   so the PR-57748 push_registers host/target hunks were dropped (they only
   mattered for arm/ia32 targets — revisit if armeabi-v7a is ever added)
 - the x64 trap-handler OS gate already lists ios upstream; the ios addition
   was kept only on the arm64-target x64-simulator sub-gate
 - retained: maglev scrape in v8_compiler_sources, unconditional real
   compiler sources for mksnapshot, -latomic for android, platform-linux.h,
   host_os-aware host toolset sources, ndk_cpufeatures targets
---
